<title>ITALY: MOTORCYCLING-SAN MARINO GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-SAN MARINO GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>IMOLA, Italy 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Practice times set on Friday</p>
<p>for Sunday's San Marino 500cc motorcycling Grand Prix:</p>
<p> 1. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda	one minute 50.250</p>
<p> 2. Jean-Michel Bayle (France) Yamaha		  1:50.727</p>
<p> 3. Norifumi Abe (Japan) Yamaha			  1:50.858</p>
<p> 4. Luca Cadalora (Italy) Honda			  1:51.006</p>
<p> 5. Alex Criville (Spain) Honda			  1:51.075</p>
<p> 6. Scott Russell (United States) Suzuki	     1:51.287</p>
<p> 7. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda			 1:51.528</p>
<p> 8. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda			   1:51.588</p>
<p> 9. Alexandre Barros (Brazil) Honda		    1:51.784</p>
<p> 10. Shinichi Itoh (Japan) Honda			 1:51.857</p>
